Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 17:36:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3590/3593] ASoC: dt-bindings: rockchip: rk3576-sai: Add RK3528
 compatible

The RK3528 has four instances of the same Serial Audio Interface (SAI)
controller as the RK3576, one of them (SAI3) being internally connected
to the HDMI transmitter.

Add a compatible for it, with the RK3576 one as fallback.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/sound/rockchip,rk3576-sai.yaml      | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/rockchip,rk3576-sai.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/rockchip,rk3576-sai.yaml
index 149da9a91..acc75f352 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/rockchip,rk3576-sai.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/rockchip,rk3576-sai.yaml
@@ -18,7 +18,11 @@ allOf:
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: rockchip,rk3576-sai
+    oneOf:
+      - const: rockchip,rk3576-sai
+      - items:
+          - const: rockchip,rk3528-sai
+          - const: rockchip,rk3576-sai
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
